  title: {fileID: 1560184791}
  description: {fileID: 515489643}
  panelColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0.7058824}
  characterName: Little Red
  characterDescription: "The ink awakens Little Red, the girl in the hood, a girl
    twisted endlessly into warnings and cautionary tales for the caging of others.
    Throughout her many lives, she has carried her family\u2019s suffering and her
    role of the forever hunted and forever lost. But as a forest changes, the story
    changes, and as does she. The wolves that stalked her now run beside her, the
    brambles that tore her cloak now crown her shoulders. Red sheds her fear and
    rises as nature\u2019s voice and its fury. \r\n\r\n\u201CNature is not a thing
    to be contained and controlled, but a thing to be endured and survived.\u201D"
  faction: 1
  characterDeck:
  - cardName: LittleRed
    numCopies: 2
    items: []
    price: 0
  - cardName: LittleRedCap
