  title: {fileID: 1560184791}
  description: {fileID: 515489643}
  panelColor: {r: 0, g: 1, b: 0, a: 0.7058824}
  characterName: Pinocchio
  characterDescription: "The ink awakens Pinocchio, a clever child and notorious
    liar. Cursed to relive his story, he has faced and been forced to commit the
    same failures countless times. His inability to do right by his father, to convince
    his people of what he knows, and his powerlessness to save his friends from the
    curse of transformation. No longer will he accept the usual script. \r\n\r\n\"Sometimes
    the only thing that separates a lie from fact is belief. I believe I can save
    my friends, so I will.\u201D"
  faction: 0
  characterDeck:
  - cardName: Pinocchio
    numCopies: 2
    items: []
    price: 0
  - cardName: TheCoachman
