  panelColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 1, a: 0.7058824}
  characterName: Humpty Dumpty
  characterDescription: "A clumsy soldier from the melting pot of Omelopolis, ready
    to defend his city, yet deemed fragile by his peers and superiors. Yet in a moment
    of clarity, the ink allows him to see his story, showing him his city\u2019s
    ruin and the echo of countless endings before. Refusing to accept his city\u2019s
    destiny, he harnesses the ink around him and vows to fight for a better ending:
    \r\n\r\n\u201CNo matter how I am cracked\r\nand how many men,\r\nI will forever
    come back,\r\nrise stronger again.\u201D"
  faction: 2
