  m_text: "Humpty Dumpty, short and clumsy, \r\nstands sentinel on a wall. \nHe is
    all that stands between a \ncity and its fall. \r\nRight from his chest, \nstoic
    he says\r \n\u201CNo matter how I am cracked \nand how many men, \nI will forever
    come back, \nrise stronger again.\u201D\r"
